            "review_text": "Nicolai W\nCopenhagen, Denmark68 contributions\n0\nTea room and bar in the hotel lobby\nJul 2017 • Business\nThe Lounge is the spacious hotel bar of Hotel Nikko Saigon. In the afternoon it functions as a meeting place and tea room for guests of the hotel. In the evening it changes into a cocktail bar, where guests can have a drink before heading out or going to bed. The elegant design and the formal style of the staff doesn't make it a very lively bar though.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2017",
