            "review_title": "Review at The Lounge",
            "review_text": "Maryanne P\nGreater Melbourne, Australia114 contributions\n0\nVery relaxing end to a busy day\nAug 2016 • Family\nWe enjoyed local beers in The Lounge every afternoon for the three nights we were here. There is a separate smokers area which was great for us to enjoy a Tiger beer and a smoke. The beer is really cold and served at the table in a long chilled glass accompanied by warm salted peanuts and a cold hand towel. The service is excellent. The staff are very friendly and professional and remembered us from the night before and showed us directly to \"our\" table. A very enjoyable way to have a chat and enjoy your drink!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 19, 2016",
